     5→ * Purpose: Display individual habit with all tracking info
     6→ * Variants: Default (not completed), Completed (checkmark, muted), At Risk (warning, <40% prediction)
     7→ * States: Default, Pressed, Swiping, Long-press, Disabled
     8→ * Includes: Habit name + icon, color accent bar, strength indicator (compact), today's status, swipe handlers
     9→ * Usage: Main list item on Home screen
    10→ */
